{"unit_id":"wensincai__btw4DeepseekHarness#card-zh","repo":"wensincai/btw4DeepseekHarness","commit":"04a6e329039629cafc037ce3ee7d9c66d18eb54c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-btw（DSH 插件）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供侧边提问和会话备忘。它通过 commands 注册 /btw 与 /remember，并向 system prompt 注入当前会话的备忘。/btw 将问题交给 fork 子代理，以父会话已完成回合为上下文、禁用工具并返回一次性答案；/remember 支持记录、列出、清空和删除备忘，记录会持久化并在后续请求中注入。适合希望快速旁问或让模型记住会话信息的 DSH 用户。无需额外账号或 API Key，需安装到支持命令和提示注册表的 profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:222-252","src/index.js:263-329","src/index.js:339-395"]}
{"unit_id":"wensincai__btw4DeepseekHarness#card-en","repo":"wensincai/btw4DeepseekHarness","commit":"04a6e329039629cafc037ce3ee7d9c66d18eb54c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-btw adds /btw side questions and /remember session notes to DSH. Side questions use a forked, tool-free helper and return a one-time answer. Notes can be added, listed, cleared, or removed; they persist and appear in later prompts. Requires a profile with command and prompt registries.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:222-252","src/index.js:263-329","src/index.js:339-395"]}
